sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Req as Request
    participant Cl as Classifier
    participant Inf as Inference
    participant Fb as Fallback policy
    Req->>Cl: screen before generating
    alt classifier healthy
        Cl-->>Inf: verdict within its latency budget
        Inf-->>Req: generate
    else classifier slow or down
        Cl--xReq: no verdict in time
        Req->>Fb: what now?
        alt fail closed
            Fb-->>Req: refuse — safe, but an outage for everyone
        else fail open
            Fb-->>Inf: proceed unscreened — available, but unsafe
        end
        Note over Fb: a tier-0 dependency on the request path — decide this before it happens, not during
    end
